The privacy policy of the Ephyra app (formerly Findroid CE) is published at
https://midasvo.nl/ephyra/privacy.html. Its source is site/privacy.html in this repository.

In short: Ephyra does not collect or access any personal information. No identifying information or
user data of any kind is made available to third parties. The app only talks to the Jellyfin servers
you add yourself.

Inquiries can be submitted via https://github.com/midasvo/ephyra/issues.
